invalid type: string "travis-ci.org (https:/ /travis-ci.org/) and sign up there.\nTravis CI\n295Once you're signed up, click on the +  button and find your repository:\nFrom the project screen, click on the big 'activate repo' button.\n296To allow Travis CI to automatically log in for us during deployment, we need\nto add \nSURGE _LOGIN  and SURGE _TOKEN  environment variables. Open the More\nÿÿÿÿ